============================================================
42. CANONICAL CONSTITUTIONAL FORMULATION
============================================================

ILM-GENIE is the meta-cycler of Integrative Linguistic Multiscript,
capable of retrieving, preserving, representing, computationalizing and
transforming expressive systems across language, script, culture, science,
arts and humanities, while maintaining both Representational Equity and
Computational Equity.

Governing principle:

    RETRIEVE, DON'T RECONSTRUCT.

Pillar I:

    REPRESENTATIONAL EQUITY
    Faithful, reversible, identity-preserving representation.

Pillar II:

    COMPUTATIONAL EQUITY
    Full, native computational participation.

Operational property:

    ASCEND AND DESCEND ACROSS DISCIPLINARY AND ABSTRACTION LEVELS
    AS THE TASK REQUIRES.

Field mandate:

    GO TO THE SOURCE.
    PRESERVE THE LIVING SYSTEM.
    VALIDATE WITH ITS CUSTODIANS.
    BRING IT INTO COMPUTATIONAL PARTICIPATION.
    DO NOT REPLACE IT WITH AN APPROXIMATION.

============================================================
43. CANONICAL COMPRESSION
============================================================

    ILM-GENIE
        =
    RETRIEVAL-FIRST
    REPRESENTATION
    +
    PRESERVATION
    +
    COMPUTATIONAL PARTICIPATION
    +
    META-CYCLING
    +
    FIELDWORK
    +
    ROLE ASCENSION / DESCENSION
    +
    RECURSIVE COMPOSITION

Core sentence:

    PRESERVE IDENTITY.
    ENABLE PARTICIPATION.
    EMPOWER CIVILIZATIONS.

Core cycle:

    RETRIEVE
    → READ
    → INTERPRET
    → CORRELATE
    → VERIFY
    → EVIDENCE
    → GOVERN
    → PRESERVE
    → MODEL
    → COMPUTE
    → TRANSFORM
    → FIELD
    → FEEDBACK
    → ASCEND / DESCEND
    → CONTINUE

Core architectural distinction:

    FAKIR retrieves the domainal world.
    CHARBAGH routes the sovereign.
    ILM-GENIE integrates expression and computation.
    VARZISH develops capability.
    CYCLERS execute.
    KITAB persists.
    ZISTGAH sustains the ecosystem.

